# variants/kits/system/worker — the worker's thin host: containers, VMs, its own disks
#
# LEAF set: a flat list of atoms. See kits/core/base for the layering contract.
#
# The worker is core + podman + KVM (2026-10-06): Shidashi, QEMU, OVMF, virtiofsd
# and syft run INSIDE containers, never in this image. KVM needs no package (the
# dist kernel carries kvm_amd/kvm_intel). smartmontools stays here because it reads
# the machine's own disks with no network and no container.

app-containers/podman
sys-apps/smartmontools
